      "messages": [
        {
          "content": "Juror-3 independent review (session 4, case-13253a3d87a8-0003): The courier delivery log for route 9 shows twelve parcels with recorded delivery times. The latest delivery is P-12 at 16:44. The deadline is 17:00. Since every parcel was delivered by 16:44 and 16:44 < 17:00, the claim that all twelve parcels were delivered before the deadline is supported by the evidence. No challenger evidence has been posted.",
