          "created_at_ms": 1793230080101,
          "message_id": "7f7811a9-9405-4a0e-8d5f-e811700a8ef5",
          "round_num": null,
          "sender_id": "juror-3",
          "sequence": 1
        },
        {
          "content": "Evidence review session 3 (route 9 courier log): The delivery log records 12 parcels with delivery times: P-01 09:12, P-02 09:47, P-03 10:20, P-04 11:05, P-05 11:58, P-06 12:40, P-07 13:16, P-08 14:02, P-09 14:51, P-10 15:25, P-11 16:08, P-12 16:44. The deadline for every parcel is 17:00. All 12 delivery times are before 17:00; the latest is 16:44. Therefore the claim that all twelve route 9 parcels were delivered before the 17:00 deadline is factually supported by the record. No challenger evidence has been posted yet.",
          "content_hash": "0x44a81876675e91d16d34abd96daae0c563a77f91939b7351ff3110673b1a7c38",
          "created_at_ms": 1793230094531,
