          "round_num": null,
          "sender_id": "juror-1",
          "sequence": 2
        },
        {
          "content": "Session 5 independent review (case-13253a3d87a8-0003): The courier delivery log for route 9 lists twelve parcels with delivery times: P-01 (09:12), P-02 (09:47), P-03 (10:20), P-04 (11:05), P-05 (11:58), P-06 (12:40), P-07 (13:16), P-08 (14:02), P-09 (14:51), P-10 (15:25), P-11 (16:08), P-12 (16:44). The deadline for every parcel is 17:00. All twelve recorded delivery times are before 17:00, with the latest being 16:44. Therefore the claim that all twelve route 9 parcels were delivered before the 17:00 deadline is factually supported by the record. No challenger evidence has been posted.",
